# Scratch queue rows CBO (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/CBO.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title SQ-CBO Creative Brewing with and without its optional dependencies, 2026-11-06 ([creative_brewing.md](../creative_brewing.md) 2.4, 2.5 and 6, [plan_cb_publish.md](../plan_cb_publish.md) M2, TODO `creativebrewing/publish #10`)
@@date 2026-11-06
@@jars creativebrewing creativecommon
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_brewing.md feature_writeup/plan_cb_publish.md
@@text
@@text Not run. Every Creative Brewing (CB) behavior, booted three ways: (1) the bare **chain** (only CB's hard dependencies:
@@text nothing optional), (2) **optional** = the chain plus all 24 optional dependencies in CB's `mods.toml` and their own
@@text required jars, (3) the chain plus **one** optional mod at a time (proves each guard alone: a guard that checks one mod
@@text but names another fails only here). Needs the 2026-11-06 13:23 builds of Creative Brewing and Creative Common and the 13:17 Creative
@@text Delight (`development/*/build/libs/`) copied into `CEPortTesting/mods/` with the game closed, then `port_chain.sh check`
@@text clean. CEPortTesting has 10 of the 24 optional mods; `port_chain.sh` takes the rest from the pack's `mods/` (read only).
@@text Tools (2026-11-06): `port_chain.sh server OUT LEVEL A optional`, `ADD="glob,glob"` (comma-separated, jar names
@@text with spaces work) on a `chain` server, `port_chain.sh bare optional` for the client; probe `tools/scratch_query/cbo_probe.js`
@@text (copied into every port_chain server as `zz_cbo_probe.js`: `/cbo mods|effects|potions|all`). All server rows are group
@@text A (superflat, blocks at y -61). **Effect check pattern** (rows say "golem check"): `> forceload add 0 0`; `> summon
@@text minecraft:iron_golem 0 -60 5 {Tags:["cbo"],NoAI:1b}`; `> effect give @e[tag=cbo] <from> 60 0`; `> data get entity
@@text @e[tag=cbo,limit=1] ActiveEffects` (Forge writes the effect id as `"forge:id": "<id>"`); `> kill @e[tag=cbo]`.
@@text **Base checks S** (every boot below): `bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$`;
@@text `bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory\|Mixin apply failed\|InvalidMixinException\|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError\|ClassNotFoundException)\|Encountered an unexpected exception`;
@@text `shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log`;
@@text `> cbo all`: `expect effects leaks 0` (a `leak` line names an Armor or Tool Effects row whose item or effect is not
@@text registered: a missing `global.has` guard). Boots, one JVM at a time: chain 1, optional 1 (+1 restart for -18), single
@@text 24, pairs 4: about 30 boots of 2 to 3 min each, about 1.5 h. Client rows after the server rows.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-CBO-01 | chain: optional mods absent, no effect leaks, reference namespaces
@group A (chain)
@commands `port_chain.sh server OUT cbo01 A chain`; boot; checks S; `> cbo all`
@pass `expect mods loaded 0 of 24: -`; `expect effects leaks 0`; `effects items by namespace:` names only vanilla, `creativebrewing`, the members and chain mods (record the line, the reference for the single boots); `expect potion creativebrewing:long_reach registered: false`, same `false` for `buzzier_bees:long_luck`, `alexsmobs:speed_iii`, `quark:resilience`
@fails a leak line: the row in `armor_effects.js` / `tool_effects.js` (CB `kubejs_startup/creativeengineering/`) without a `global.has` block (`python3 tools/guard_check.py --jar creativebrewing`)
@from batches/r1106cbp/p1_chain.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 0 of 24: -
look record the "effects items by namespace" line (reference for the single-mod boots)
> cdevtest potion creativebrewing:long_reach
> cdevtest potion buzzier_bees:long_luck
> cdevtest potion alexsmobs:speed_iii
> cdevtest potion quark:resilience
sleep 3
expect verb=potion potion=creativebrewing:long_reach registered=false
expect verb=potion potion=buzzier_bees:long_luck registered=false
expect verb=potion potion=alexsmobs:speed_iii registered=false
expect verb=potion potion=quark:resilience registered=false
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

## SQ-CBO-02 | chain: potion, swap, alcohol, bottling, JEED counts (reference)
@group A (chain)
@commands same boot: `shell grep -h "\[CE potions\]\|\[food values\].*effect swaps\|\[alcohol\] food values\|tipped arrow tipping done\|potion bottling done\|jeed_providers.js:\|\[fluid_jei\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log`; `bootreject Lingerification:`; `bootreject registered [0-9]+ dragon-breath`
@pass record every count (reference for -10 and the single boots); `better_beacons not present - skipping` for long_reach and phantom_bane; `re-added 0 dragon-breath`; no Lingerification line (needs Immersive Engineering); no `[CE potions] mix skipped` or `effect .* not registered` WARN (a guarded mix that still ran)
@fails a `mix skipped` line names the mix: its block in `potions.js` lacks the guard; a Lingerification line: the `CreativeBrewing.commonSetup` Create + IE check
@from batches/r1106cbp/p1_chain.qb
shell grep -h "\[CE potions\]\|\[food values\].*effect swaps\|\[alcohol\] food values\|tipped arrow tipping done\|potion bottling done\|jeed_providers.js:\|\[fluid_jei\]\|dragon-breath\|Lingerification" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log | sed -E 's/^\[[^]]*\] \[[^]]*\]: //' | sort | uniq -c
bootreject Lingerification:
bootreject registered [0-9]+ dragon-breath
shell grep -h "better_beacons not present" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log | head -4
shell grep -c "better_beacons not present" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log; true
shell ! grep -hE "\[CE potions\] mix skipped|effect .* not registered" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log
look counts recorded; better_beacons skip lines for long_reach and phantom_bane; re-added 0 dragon-breath

